<<
/Title (We want to possess the ball into the final third with control. We are pragmatic - we can play direct behind the line into space if needed, we can find and create space with ball and player movement, or we can combine into dangerous areas. We are always looking to possess the ball in the final third.)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 9143 0 R
/Prev 9165 0 R
/Next 9194 0 R
>>
endobj
9194 0 obj
<<
/Title (Every time we possess the ball, anywhere on the field, we should have an idea of how we are going to possess the ball into the final third. We are not in a hurry. If the space exists behind the line and we are in a position to exploit it, do so. If the space does not exist, or we are not in a good position to take advantage of it, we can be patient and possess the ball. Swith the field, reset, combine, draw opponent out, whatever we need to do to possess the ball up high.)
